    <!-- Fix 5 (final review, 2026-09-20): the old forced line break was tuned for the pre-Task-8 dialog
         row, where the focus indicator bar narrowed the text column (521px unfocused vs 515px focused
         width at 11sp DM Sans) and an uneven wrap made the whole menu jump height on focus. The Task 8
         pill is a fixed width regardless of focus (no indicator bar eating into it), and the pill's
         height is now heightIn(min=...), so a wrap can no longer cause a jump either way. Letting
         Compose choose the break point at the current width/size (12sp, roughly a 220dp column) fits
         this on two lines with no truncation; the forced break no longer did, once Task 8 narrowed
         the column. -->
